WEBVTT

00:00:05.450 --> 00:00:08.370
We've no interest in 
what's left of the corpse.

00:00:08.370 --> 00:00:13.230
What we need is this bracelet, 
which was created by the precursors.

00:00:13.590 --> 00:00:16.040
We are ready to run
 the activation experiment!

00:00:17.060 --> 00:00:18.940
Our country got its start

00:00:18.940 --> 00:00:23.130
when people declared independence 
from a world of divine mysteries.

00:00:23.450 --> 00:00:26.540
We're putting an end to the age of the gods!

00:00:26.540 --> 00:00:30.310
It's America's destiny to illuminate 
mankind's future with the light of wisdom!

00:02:13.940 --> 00:02:18.150
Explosion During Concert
\h\hOver 70,000 Dead or Missing\h\h

00:02:13.940 --> 00:02:19.330
<i>Explosives planted under the stage resulted 
in over 70,000 people dead or missing,</i>

00:02:19.330 --> 00:02:22.560
<i>and the number is expected to rise.</i>

00:02:23.610 --> 00:02:25.410
Yeah, that's right.

00:02:25.790 --> 00:02:29.120
I'm just fine!

00:02:29.400 --> 00:02:31.340
It's true!

00:02:31.340 --> 00:02:34.110
I'll be by the apartment soon.

00:02:34.110 --> 00:02:35.450
So don't worry.

00:02:38.520 --> 00:02:43.330
Your mother and father 
still aren't living together?

00:02:44.070 --> 00:02:47.940
Sometimes they're together. 
Most of the time they're not.

00:02:48.460 --> 00:02:53.490
Issues that were ignored for 
years won't just go away.

00:02:54.260 --> 00:02:58.480
And they both have feelings that they 
can't really share with each other.

00:03:00.250 --> 00:03:01.260
Yeah.

00:03:01.260 --> 00:03:07.100
Maybe everybody has feelings 
that they just can't share...

00:03:11.840 --> 00:03:14.420
Maria-san! Are you okay?

00:03:14.420 --> 00:03:16.150
I'm just fine.

00:03:16.660 --> 00:03:18.040
But...

00:03:18.490 --> 00:03:19.880
Tsubasa-san.

00:03:19.880 --> 00:03:24.400
Her brainwaves are irregular, 
but there's nothing physically wrong with her.

00:03:24.400 --> 00:03:25.530
It's...

00:03:26.760 --> 00:03:32.260
It's like her mind is refusing to 
wake up to a nightmarish reality.

00:03:32.260 --> 00:03:33.910
I can understand...

00:03:33.910 --> 00:03:36.480
Because... it was so...

00:03:53.560 --> 00:03:57.170
Am I wrong in thinking that the 
scale and damage were too big

00:03:57.170 --> 00:03:59.630
for it to just be the 
remnants of the Illuminati?

00:03:59.630 --> 00:04:01.720
Someone may have helped them.

00:04:01.720 --> 00:04:05.600
Some powerful organization, or perhaps...

00:04:10.520 --> 00:04:12.360
Thanks!

00:04:12.360 --> 00:04:16.920
We've got the items. 
Do you need us to sign for them?

00:04:16.920 --> 00:04:19.910
No, our bosses only ordered 
us to deliver them.

00:04:19.910 --> 00:04:21.810
We need to get back.

00:04:21.810 --> 00:04:25.440
We weren't born monsters, you know?

00:04:25.440 --> 00:04:27.910
We won't try to eat you.

00:04:27.910 --> 00:04:30.980
Even with bodies like this, we're human.

00:04:30.980 --> 00:04:32.840
There's no need to be so scared...

00:04:37.010 --> 00:04:40.240
She saw us! Time to split!

00:04:40.240 --> 00:04:42.880
Damn! They saw us! Get them!

00:04:44.090 --> 00:04:45.380
They're gone, huh?

00:04:46.500 --> 00:04:50.940
They're expendable. 
Why not let them deal with this?

00:04:56.560 --> 00:04:58.630
What's going on?

00:04:58.630 --> 00:05:02.030
Alca-Noise detected near the coast!

00:05:04.100 --> 00:05:08.610
Security cameras have sighted 
Bavarian Illuminati remnants.

00:05:17.080 --> 00:05:19.600
Casualties are increasing!

00:05:19.600 --> 00:05:20.540
We need to hurry!

00:05:22.660 --> 00:05:26.390
Hibiki-kun and Chris-kun 
are already on their way!

00:05:28.880 --> 00:05:31.300
We're counting on you two.

00:05:41.360 --> 00:05:43.430
Ow...

00:05:44.440 --> 00:05:46.320
You killed my friends!

00:05:46.320 --> 00:05:48.800
Your driving was very passionate.

00:05:48.800 --> 00:05:51.770
But you're still getting a red flag.

00:05:52.240 --> 00:05:54.050
No!

00:05:54.050 --> 00:05:56.200
Gods! Angels!

00:05:56.200 --> 00:06:03.800
<i>Killiter Ichaival tron.</i>

00:06:47.920 --> 00:06:49.060
Bang!

00:06:49.390 --> 00:06:52.830
<i>The smell of gunpowder and 
smoke tickles the nose</i>

00:06:54.350 --> 00:06:58.020
<i>The clatter of empty gun cartridges</i>

00:06:58.440 --> 00:07:01.770
<i>Anybody who's in love with 
the sight of my red heels</i>

00:07:01.770 --> 00:07:08.500
<i>and wants a bullet in the brain, 
raise your hand</i>

00:07:08.500 --> 00:07:13.120
<i>Even if I shed blood, even if I'm hurt</i>

00:07:13.120 --> 00:07:20.020
<i>The winds of time and the bonds 
I have with my companions</i>

00:07:20.780 --> 00:07:25.500
<i>Will erase the pain and turn it into a scab</i>

00:07:25.500 --> 00:07:29.380
<i>It's so warm!</i>

00:07:30.660 --> 00:07:34.150
Angels! This is hell, but heaven!

00:07:30.660 --> 00:07:35.390
<i>Just live your life at 120%</i>

00:07:35.390 --> 00:07:45.570
<i>If you do, a better past and future 
will always be in your hands</i>

00:07:38.020 --> 00:07:41.220
Forget that! Just get out of here!

00:07:41.220 --> 00:07:43.370
I won't let you interfere!

00:07:46.100 --> 00:07:47.620
<i>A doubt? A stupid question</i>

00:07:48.520 --> 00:07:50.110
<i>No need for introductions</i>

00:07:49.600 --> 00:07:53.200
Ichaival and Gungnir have 
succeeded in saving one person.

00:07:51.080 --> 00:07:58.920
<i>Taste a bullet from the girl 
whose whole body is a weapon</i>

00:07:53.600 --> 00:07:55.640
We'll hurry and evacuate the citizens.

00:08:03.290 --> 00:08:06.860
<i>A head-on test of strength. If only I had...</i>

00:08:07.160 --> 00:08:08.780
I know what you're thinking.

00:08:08.780 --> 00:08:12.690
You're wishing you had your 
Ignite Module, right?

00:08:12.930 --> 00:08:17.680
We've done our research and know that you're 
weaker without your ultimate weapon.

00:08:18.460 --> 00:08:21.390
Regardless, I still can't lose!

00:08:31.980 --> 00:08:34.500
Wh-What was that?

00:08:34.500 --> 00:08:37.990
I guess if I don't catch them off guard, 
it can't do more than stun them....

00:08:38.250 --> 00:08:41.830
Elza! Don't do anything crazy 
until Vanessa gets here!

00:08:41.830 --> 00:08:43.830
Let's meet up back at the hideout!

00:08:43.830 --> 00:08:46.830
Yes, ma'am! I'm retreating!

00:08:46.840 --> 00:08:51.810
<i>I've come far enough to pull 
along the hand that holds my own</i>

00:08:51.750 --> 00:08:53.020
Elza!

00:08:51.810 --> 00:08:56.260
<i>An honest, foolish futurism</i>

00:08:56.760 --> 00:09:02.340
<i>The histories that came 
together will guide us (Fire)</i>

00:08:59.080 --> 00:08:59.970
Chris-chan!

00:09:02.340 --> 00:09:04.920
<i>Output to full (Fire)</i>

00:09:04.920 --> 00:09:07.520
<i>Locked on (Fire)</i>

00:09:07.520 --> 00:09:10.970
<i>Let it go, let loose</i>

00:09:10.970 --> 00:09:16.250
<i>Take everything that I've got!</i>

00:09:33.770 --> 00:09:36.140
We've finished analyzing the 
briefcase we recovered.

00:09:37.460 --> 00:09:39.000
I'm putting it onscreen.

00:09:39.680 --> 00:09:41.050
Is that...?

00:09:41.050 --> 00:09:42.450
Ketchup?

00:09:42.450 --> 00:09:45.000
A barbecue party at this time of year?

00:09:45.000 --> 00:09:47.190
What a terrifying enemy!

00:09:47.190 --> 00:09:49.100
That's whole blood for transfusions.

00:09:49.100 --> 00:09:51.470
Blood component transfusion 
is the common method now,

00:09:51.470 --> 00:09:54.310
so you don't see it much anymore.

00:09:54.310 --> 00:09:57.600
What's more unusual is the type of blood.

00:09:57.600 --> 00:09:59.390
RH Soil type.

00:09:59.820 --> 00:10:04.030
It's a rare blood type. 
Only one in 1.4 million people has it.

00:10:04.350 --> 00:10:08.450
Are you saying they need blood transfusions?

00:10:09.020 --> 00:10:11.200
We've finished questioning the victims.

00:10:11.520 --> 00:10:15.420
They saw the alchemists meeting 
with some men in black suits,

00:10:15.840 --> 00:10:18.330
and assumed they were 
witnessing a drug deal.

00:10:18.790 --> 00:10:24.000
So, someone's helping the remnants
 of the Bavarian Illuminati?

00:10:24.390 --> 00:10:26.220
The obvious likely suspect

00:10:26.220 --> 00:10:30.010
is the US government, which has
 interfered with us several times now.

00:10:30.500 --> 00:10:34.480
There's a plan to do a joint investigation 
of the lunar ruins as a way

00:10:34.480 --> 00:10:39.460
to restore the relations that were badly 
damaged by the launch of the reactive weapons.

00:10:39.740 --> 00:10:41.460
If we suspect them, though,

00:10:41.460 --> 00:10:44.080
we have to wonder if the plan
 is a way of hiding something.

00:10:46.000 --> 00:10:50.780
We have an incoming message that the 
Los Alamos research lab was attacked by

00:10:50.780 --> 00:10:52.730
what is believed to be 
the Bavarian Illuminati.

00:10:52.730 --> 00:10:53.890
What?!

00:11:11.950 --> 00:11:14.480
I failed...

00:11:14.970 --> 00:11:18.810
I should've died before 
I let go of the case...

00:11:18.810 --> 00:11:20.510
Don't be silly.

00:11:20.510 --> 00:11:22.710
You can't do anything if you're dead.

00:11:22.710 --> 00:11:28.910
But don't you also need the blood, Millaarc?

00:11:28.910 --> 00:11:32.270
If we don't fight, we should
 be okay for a while.

00:11:32.270 --> 00:11:35.590
By the time Vanessa gets back, 
I'll have worked something out.

00:11:36.840 --> 00:11:41.140
<i>No matter what I have to do, 
I'll make sure that Elza and Vanessa...</i>

00:11:43.510 --> 00:11:48.170
It's been a full day since we received 
the message and nothing's happened.

00:11:48.170 --> 00:11:49.760
What's your take, brother?

00:11:49.760 --> 00:11:54.630
<i>Los Alamos is the center of the US's
 most advanced technological development.</i>

00:11:54.630 --> 00:11:58.010
<i>And also where they research 
their heretical technology.</i>

00:11:58.340 --> 00:12:03.640
It's difficult to believe 
that they're behind this.

00:12:04.330 --> 00:12:06.750
American heretical technology?

00:12:06.750 --> 00:12:09.260
Yeah. We can't be sure,

00:12:09.260 --> 00:12:14.550
but we believe that the FIS was 
once part of Los Alamos, as well.

00:12:16.660 --> 00:12:19.860
In addition to being the first lab 
to develop nuclear energy,

00:12:19.860 --> 00:12:25.380
Los Alamos is also where cutting edge 
technology like Echelon was created.

00:12:25.720 --> 00:12:30.530
If they attacked a place like that, 
they must be after something important, right?

00:12:30.880 --> 00:12:32.840
From the information we got,

00:12:32.840 --> 00:12:36.560
they took several relics that are
 believed to have no real power.

00:12:37.250 --> 00:12:38.260
As well as...

00:12:38.820 --> 00:12:41.900
Is that... I knew it!

00:12:42.540 --> 00:12:45.930
<i>The precursor relic recovered at the pole.</i>

00:12:45.930 --> 00:12:53.530
<i>There are cuneiform words written
 on the bracelet which read "Shem-ha."</i>

00:12:54.040 --> 00:12:57.410
Shem-ha... The bracelet of Shem-ha...

00:12:58.100 --> 00:13:03.030
<i>We'll continue to ask the US government
 for help in resolving this matter.</i>

00:13:03.030 --> 00:13:05.520
<i>This is my battle.</i>

00:13:06.920 --> 00:13:09.410
Thank you, Brother Yatsuhiro.

00:13:18.780 --> 00:13:21.720
You're okay now, huh, Tsubasa-san?

00:13:29.920 --> 00:13:34.230
Tsubasa-san... didn't look okay to me.

00:13:34.230 --> 00:13:38.580
I can't believe that happened 
right after she recovered.

00:13:39.900 --> 00:13:41.840
I'm sorry for worrying you.

00:13:41.840 --> 00:13:43.640
But I'm okay now.

00:13:45.630 --> 00:13:49.440
<i>Okay in what sense?</i>

00:13:52.120 --> 00:13:53.680
Grandfather...

00:13:53.680 --> 00:13:58.400
This matter, in which you allowed 
foreign enemies to attack our soil...

00:13:58.400 --> 00:14:00.930
I won't let you say you've 
forgotten, Tsubasa!

00:14:00.930 --> 00:14:03.150
Of course, I haven't forgotten.

00:14:03.150 --> 00:14:06.630
This tragedy is something
 that must not be forgotten,

00:14:06.630 --> 00:14:09.170
and something I must bear the weight of.

00:14:10.190 --> 00:14:13.290
Know that you cannot be a true protector,

00:14:13.290 --> 00:14:18.070
and so it is impossible for 
you to protect all people!

00:14:19.360 --> 00:14:22.340
I can't protect them right now?

00:14:22.600 --> 00:14:26.080
Songs cannot protect the world.

00:14:27.800 --> 00:14:30.360
Songs can't protect the world?

00:14:31.560 --> 00:14:37.660
I still have hopes that the blood 
of the protectors is within you.

00:14:42.620 --> 00:14:44.080
Tsubasa-san...

00:14:44.770 --> 00:14:46.730
Don't worry, Tachibana.

00:14:48.020 --> 00:14:52.110
A unbashful blade will not break easily.

00:14:56.510 --> 00:15:00.410
And Akatsuki wins the gold medal 
with her perfect landing!

00:15:01.470 --> 00:15:04.170
We still don't know who 
the enemy really is...

00:15:05.550 --> 00:15:11.700
Anyway, if they want blood, 
our enemies are real vampires, huh?

00:15:13.180 --> 00:15:14.660
What's wrong, Kiri-chan?

00:15:14.660 --> 00:15:16.530
I figured it out!

00:15:16.530 --> 00:15:21.110
They're bound to attack a place 
with lots of blood next!

00:15:21.350 --> 00:15:23.940
For example, a blood donation center,

00:15:23.940 --> 00:15:26.970
or a big hospital like that!

00:15:26.970 --> 00:15:29.540
It's not that simple.

00:15:35.150 --> 00:15:36.780
So, you see...

00:15:37.580 --> 00:15:40.630
Hey, visiting hours are over!

00:15:40.960 --> 00:15:42.850
<i>We saw it, too.</i>

00:15:42.850 --> 00:15:45.760
<i>But it's dangerous. Don't proceed on your own.</i>

00:15:45.760 --> 00:15:48.420
There's no time!

00:15:48.690 --> 00:15:51.690
We're the closest to the scene. 
Leave it to us!

00:15:51.690 --> 00:15:54.550
Ending communication. Commencing assault!

00:15:57.040 --> 00:15:59.930
<i>I think I'm at my limit...</i>

00:16:01.120 --> 00:16:02.140
Wait!

00:16:02.140 --> 00:16:05.930
We're willing to get rough if we have to,

00:16:05.930 --> 00:16:09.400
but first, tell us who you 
are and what you want!

00:16:09.400 --> 00:16:13.070
There's no time for that!

00:16:17.160 --> 00:16:24.870
<i>Various Shul Shagana tron.</i>

00:17:04.210 --> 00:17:05.040
Kill.

00:17:09.290 --> 00:17:10.190
Okay.

00:17:11.680 --> 00:17:14.620
<i>With a shining blade</i>

00:17:14.620 --> 00:17:18.290
<i>Cabbage cut in half</i>

00:17:18.290 --> 00:17:24.490
<i>I did extra homework on how to slaughter you</i>

00:17:24.490 --> 00:17:30.900
<i>I'll run through the field with 
high output and full strength</i>

00:17:30.900 --> 00:17:36.520
<i>I dive in with my all for 
both my dreams and my fights</i>

00:17:34.830 --> 00:17:38.610
The enemy is after the 
RH Soil whole blood type.

00:17:36.970 --> 00:17:43.580
<i>Let's sing when our songs overlap</i>

00:17:38.610 --> 00:17:40.570
This is perfect, then.

00:17:40.570 --> 00:17:43.960
If we can destroy them while their 
actions are easy to predict...

00:17:43.580 --> 00:17:50.040
<i>we'll rip apart even the tallest 
wall and create the future</i>

00:17:50.040 --> 00:17:52.430
<i>Our dreams won't lose</i>

00:17:50.730 --> 00:17:52.440
<b>Calamity Ring Tinkerbell</b>

00:17:52.430 --> 00:17:58.210
<i>Push through it with your
 strong love - ready, go!</i>

00:17:58.210 --> 00:18:04.370
<i>I may be inexperienced and
 incomplete but I won't run away</i>

00:18:04.370 --> 00:18:10.570
<i>When I believed and overcame, 
my history became stars</i>

00:18:10.570 --> 00:18:17.910
<i>now illuminate this moment 
with light and support</i>

00:18:14.400 --> 00:18:19.100
Your actions are illegal under some 
law whose name I can't remember!

00:18:17.910 --> 00:18:21.280
<i>See, someone's waiting for you</i>

00:18:19.100 --> 00:18:21.290
Cease resisting!

00:18:22.030 --> 00:18:27.160
<i>Let's go together. Twin heart!</i>

00:18:27.140 --> 00:18:29.670
You're not used to talking like that, 
and your voice is pissing me off!

00:18:30.790 --> 00:18:34.920
Your cowardly tricks can't stop 
me when you're that slow!

00:18:39.180 --> 00:18:42.180
Shirabe, let's bring together 
the blades of Zababa!

00:18:42.170 --> 00:18:49.520
<i>Ready, go! I may be inexperienced 
and incomplete but I won't run away</i>

00:18:49.520 --> 00:18:55.650
<i>When I believed and overcame, 
my history became stars</i>

00:18:55.650 --> 00:19:02.730
<i>now illuminate this moment 
with light and support</i>

00:19:02.730 --> 00:19:06.830
<i>See, someone's waiting for you</i>

00:19:06.830 --> 00:19:11.910
<i>Let's go together. Twin heart!</i>

00:19:31.060 --> 00:19:32.300
We did it!

00:19:32.300 --> 00:19:35.660
I think we overdid it!

00:19:41.390 --> 00:19:42.670
I won't lose...

00:19:43.280 --> 00:19:44.700
I can't lose!

00:19:45.400 --> 00:19:48.530
I'm going to protect the two of them...

00:19:49.020 --> 00:19:51.490
My family!

00:19:52.280 --> 00:19:53.460
Family?

00:19:55.370 --> 00:20:00.710
"Family"? That's a little bit 
embarrassing, but I don't mind.

00:20:00.710 --> 00:20:01.800
Thank you.

00:20:14.590 --> 00:20:15.960
The lights went out!

00:20:15.960 --> 00:20:17.520
I can't see anything!

00:20:17.520 --> 00:20:19.480
Kiri-chan, calm down!

00:20:26.850 --> 00:20:30.270
I brought down every system in the area.

00:20:30.270 --> 00:20:35.450
You'd better hurry, or a lot of people in 
that hospital aren't going to survive.

00:20:35.450 --> 00:20:37.560
She's taking the patients hostage.

00:20:37.560 --> 00:20:39.050
She's...

00:20:39.350 --> 00:20:41.890
You came, Vanessa!

00:20:43.410 --> 00:20:47.160
She's not the only one.

00:20:47.160 --> 00:20:52.580
And I got what we needed during the fight.

00:20:54.640 --> 00:20:57.520
Vanessa! Elza! Time for a Daedalus End!

00:20:58.420 --> 00:21:02.280
With all of us together, 
we can use our full power...

00:21:05.300 --> 00:21:07.660
Next time.

00:21:08.200 --> 00:21:13.090
The two of you are in bad shape. 
I don't want to push you.

00:21:13.510 --> 00:21:15.290
Let's retreat.

00:21:15.290 --> 00:21:17.230
Big sister's making the call.

00:21:18.210 --> 00:21:19.580
Who are you?

00:21:20.140 --> 00:21:25.180
Noble Red. I'm sure we'll see you again.

00:21:25.480 --> 00:21:26.780
We won't let you escape!

00:21:26.780 --> 00:21:27.700
No!

00:21:30.760 --> 00:21:33.480
Kiri-chan, we need to 
help the patients first!

00:21:34.790 --> 00:21:35.780
Death!

00:21:51.870 --> 00:21:56.940
Here's what you wanted. 
The bracelet of Shem-ha.

00:21:58.220 --> 00:22:01.910
Indeed. Even if it was reborn seven times,

00:22:01.910 --> 00:22:08.290
this is still the power of the gods, 
needed for the divine nation of Japan.
